  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "哈，哈......可恶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "总算......解决了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......不，还没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "那些空中飘荡下来的粉尘......是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕，咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好疼......好疼啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊......啊啊！好痒，好痒！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗......罗德岛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敌人......敌人！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "什......！怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "刚才被打倒的整合运动又站起来了——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "怎么？不行了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "光芒，从那个家伙的法杖里......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我可还没有动手哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "而且......还有更多敌人增援....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "可恶......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "现在，只能依赖这一发弩弹能把敌人的首领......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "哈哈......这种情况下，你们还有讨论的余裕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "真自信啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "呵，就让这发弩弹教教你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "不，陨星。不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "啧......！为什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "快撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "我感受到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "是他们。他们来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "嗯？不射击吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "真可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "之后，你们就没机会了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "他要撤退了？可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "陨星！射击西侧那栋危楼，快！至少可以分散敌人的注意力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......只能这样了！没问题！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "杰西卡，跑起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "......雪怪们来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "好、好冷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "................走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "立刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......杰西卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "她说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "我们快走......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "阿米娅，听得见吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "喂，喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "快走！我掩护你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "听好，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——不要来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "这个废城分城是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
